Subject: [PATCH v2 2/4] drm/mediatek: Remove struct cmdq_client
Date: Mon,  9 Aug 2021 07:47:31 +0800
Message-Id: <20210808234733.14782-3-chunkuang.hu@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.25.1
